:: StoryTitle
A weekend plan, almost

:: StoryData
{"ifid":"DB0A0310-85B7-4CDA-A2B0-000000000002","format":"SugarCube","format-version":"2.37.3","start":"Start"}

:: StoryScript [script]
setup.episode={"id":"weekend","version":3,"title":"A weekend plan, almost","subtitle":"Find a shared interest. Agree on the same day.","place":"School gate","newWords":["周末","有空","星期六"],"ending":"Our calendars finally agree: Saturday, two in the afternoon. I found something in common and caught a small misunderstanding before it became an empty table.","scenes":[{"id":"conversation-1","title":"The kettle conference","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["At school, I reach the kettle at the same time as Chen, a colleague with round glasses and a precarious stack of books. I remember Ms Lin’s invitation for Saturday. Perhaps these two plans can become one."],"line":{"zh":"你周末有空吗？","english":"Are you free this weekend?","pinyin":"nǐ zhōu mò yǒu kōng ma ？","audio":"audio/ddf31935456f9a389761.m4a"},"kind":"choice","clue":"Tell Chen you are free on Saturday.","choices":[{"id":"reply","label":"Tell Chen you are free on Saturday.","simple":{"chunks":["我","星期六","有空"],"english":"I am free on Saturday.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["wǒ","xīng qī liù","yǒu kōng"],"audio":"audio/34e0a35d2cfdd7e1ecd1.m4a"},"rich":{"chunks":["我","星期六","有空"],"english":"I am free on Saturday.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["wǒ","xīng qī liù","yǒu kōng"],"audio":"audio/34e0a35d2cfdd7e1ecd1.m4a"},"hint":"Listen again and look for the part that answers the question.","response":"","responseLine":{"zh":"太好了！我也有空。","english":"Great! I am free too.","pinyin":"tài hǎo le ！ wǒ yě yǒu kōng 。","audio":"audio/581638086716b6fe1b20.m4a"}}],"options":[{"id":"correct","correct":true,"simple":"我星期六有空","rich":"我星期六有空","simplePinyin":"wǒ xīng qī liù yǒu kōng","simpleAudio":"audio/34e0a35d2cfdd7e1ecd1.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ xīng qī liù yǒu kōng","richAudio":"audio/34e0a35d2cfdd7e1ecd1.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-1","simple":"我在学校教英语。","rich":"我在学校教英语。","feedback":"He is asking about availability, not your job.","simplePinyin":"wǒ zài xué xiào jiào yīng yǔ 。","simpleAudio":"audio/19effdd6caad9e045c79.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ zài xué xiào jiào yīng yǔ 。","richAudio":"audio/19effdd6caad9e045c79.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-2","simple":"我昨天去了学校。","rich":"我昨天去了学校。","feedback":"昨天 refers to yesterday; listen for 周末.","simplePinyin":"wǒ zuó tiān qù le xué xiào 。","simpleAudio":"audio/b6fedaaeea846ffe1c1b.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ zuó tiān qù le xué xiào 。","richAudio":"audio/b6fedaaeea846ffe1c1b.m4a"}],"aside":{"question":"Recall this moment","answer":"At school, I reach the kettle at the same time as Chen, a colleague with round glasses and a precarious stack of books. I remember Ms Lin’s invitation for Saturday. Perhaps these two plans can become one."}},{"id":"conversation-2","title":"Something in common","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["Chen sets down the books and tells me how he likes to relax. We may have something in common. I listen for his favourite activity before replying."],"line":{"zh":"我喜欢喝茶。你呢？","english":"I like drinking tea. What about you?","pinyin":"wǒ xǐ huan hē chá 。 nǐ ne ？","audio":"audio/f95a840cde3279fb282e.m4a"},"kind":"choice","clue":"Listen for his interest, then say you share it.","choices":[{"id":"reply","label":"Listen for his interest, then say you share it.","simple":{"chunks":["我","也","喜欢","喝茶"],"english":"I like drinking tea too.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["wǒ","yě","xǐ huan","hē chá"],"audio":"audio/0a99e5f80c685e4f501c.m4a"},"rich":{"chunks":["我","也","喜欢","喝茶"],"english":"I like drinking tea too.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["wǒ","yě","xǐ huan","hē chá"],"audio":"audio/0a99e5f80c685e4f501c.m4a"},"hint":"Listen for his interest, then say you share it.","response":"","responseLine":{"zh":"那我们一起去喝茶吧！","english":"Then let’s go for tea together!","pinyin":"nà wǒ men yì qǐ qù hē chá ba ！","audio":"audio/63d9d2ab4827443f6259.m4a"}}],"options":[{"id":"correct","correct":true,"simple":"我也喜欢喝茶","rich":"我也喜欢喝茶","simplePinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan hē chá","simpleAudio":"audio/0a99e5f80c685e4f501c.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan hē chá","richAudio":"audio/0a99e5f80c685e4f501c.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-1","simple":"我也喜欢看书。","rich":"我也喜欢看书。","feedback":"Listen again for the activity.","simplePinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan kàn shū 。","simpleAudio":"audio/e6bbe0e8d9019f92cce3.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan kàn shū 。","richAudio":"audio/e6bbe0e8d9019f92cce3.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-2","simple":"我也喜欢跑步。","rich":"我也喜欢跑步。","feedback":"Listen again for the activity.","simplePinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan pǎo bù 。","simpleAudio":"audio/407b6547575afe3f2f22.m4a","richPinyin":"wǒ yě xǐ huan pǎo bù 。","richAudio":"audio/407b6547575afe3f2f22.m4a"}],"aside":{"question":"Recall this moment","answer":"Chen sets down the books and tells me how he likes to relax. We may have something in common. I listen for his favourite activity before replying."},"promptMode":"listen"},{"id":"conversation-3","title":"Two calendars, two days","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["I show Chen the teahouse on a map. He types a day into his phone: Sunday. I meant Saturday. One of us will have a very lonely cup of tea if I only smile now."],"line":{"zh":"星期天，对吗？","english":"Sunday, right?","pinyin":"xīng qī tiān ， duì ma ？","audio":"audio/3de6753e78cbb068e431.m4a"},"kind":"choice","clue":"Correct the day: Saturday, not Sunday.","choices":[{"id":"reply","label":"Correct the day: Saturday, not Sunday.","simple":{"chunks":["是","星期六","不是","星期天"],"english":"It is Saturday, not Sunday.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["shì","xīng qī liù","bú shì","xīng qī tiān"],"audio":"audio/7487824b67e7d4f35c3e.m4a"},"rich":{"chunks":["是","星期六","不是","星期天"],"english":"It is Saturday, not Sunday.","distractorPinyin":[],"pinyin":["shì","xīng qī liù","bú shì","xīng qī tiān"],"audio":"audio/7487824b67e7d4f35c3e.m4a"},"hint":"Listen again and look for the part that answers the question.","response":"","responseLine":{"zh":"哦，星期六！下午两点，可以吗？","english":"Oh, Saturday! Is two in the afternoon okay?","pinyin":"ò ， xīng qī liù ！ xià wǔ liǎng diǎn ， kě yǐ ma ？","audio":"audio/78cda40dd6f6a73bf68b.m4a"}}],"options":[{"id":"correct","correct":true,"simple":"是星期六不是星期天","rich":"是星期六不是星期天","simplePinyin":"shì xīng qī liù bú shì xīng qī tiān","simpleAudio":"audio/7487824b67e7d4f35c3e.m4a","richPinyin":"shì xīng qī liù bú shì xīng qī tiān","richAudio":"audio/7487824b67e7d4f35c3e.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-1","simple":"对，星期天见。","rich":"对，星期天见。","feedback":"That agrees to Sunday. Check the day on his screen.","simplePinyin":"duì ， xīng qī tiān jiàn 。","simpleAudio":"audio/f2f7bf164d5f201eda57.m4a","richPinyin":"duì ， xīng qī tiān jiàn 。","richAudio":"audio/f2f7bf164d5f201eda57.m4a"},{"id":"wrong-2","simple":"星期六我没有空。","rich":"星期六我没有空。","feedback":"That says you are busy on Saturday, which is your planned day.","simplePinyin":"xīng qī liù wǒ méi yǒu kōng 。","simpleAudio":"audio/fc20ce9794b782097676.m4a","richPinyin":"xīng qī liù wǒ méi yǒu kōng 。","richAudio":"audio/fc20ce9794b782097676.m4a"}],"aside":{"question":"Recall this moment","answer":"I show Chen the teahouse on a map. He types a day into his phone: Sunday. I meant Saturday. One of us will have a very lonely cup of tea if I only smile now."}},{"id":"conversation-4","title":"Say it once more","speaker":"chen","paragraphs":["Two o’clock works. We save the same map pin, and Chen corrects his calendar. The bell rings before I put away my phone. One final sentence can hold the whole plan together."],"line":{"zh":"好，我们什么时候见？","english":"Okay, when shall we meet?","pinyin":"hǎo ， wǒ men shén me shí hòu jiàn ？","audio":"audio/737ba464eea621fcd1a7.m4a"},"kind":"build","clue":"Confirm that you will meet on Saturday at two in the afternoon.","choices":[{"id":"reply","label":"Confirm that you will meet on Saturday at two in the afternoon.","simple":{"chunks":["我们","星期六","下午","两点","见","吧"],"english":"Let’s meet on Saturday at two in the afternoon.","distractors":["星期天","上午"],"alternatives":[[1,2,3,0,4,5],[1,0,2,3,4,5]],"distractorPinyin":["xīng qī tiān","shàng wǔ"],"pinyin":["wǒ men","xīng qī liù","xià wǔ","liǎng diǎn","jiàn","ba"],"audio":"audio/a6469e8ce380ba7d846c.m4a"},"rich":{"chunks":["我们","星期六","下午","两点","见","吧"],"english":"Let’s meet on Saturday at two in the afternoon.","distractors":["星期天","上午"],"alternatives":[[1,2,3,0,4,5],[1,0,2,3,4,5]],"distractorPinyin":["xīng qī tiān","shàng wǔ"],"pinyin":["wǒ men","xīng qī liù","xià wǔ","liǎng diǎn","jiàn","ba"],"audio":"audio/a6469e8ce380ba7d846c.m4a"},"hint":"Put the day before 下午两点, then 见. 吧 finishes the suggestion.","response":"","responseLine":{"zh":"好！星期六下午两点见！","english":"Great! See you Saturday at two in the afternoon!","pinyin":"hǎo ！ xīng qī liù xià wǔ liǎng diǎn jiàn ！","audio":"audio/2516e78141c4bef0f968.m4a"}}],"aside":{"question":"Recall this moment","answer":"Two o’clock works. We save the same map pin, and Chen corrects his calendar. The bell rings before I put away my phone. One final sentence can hold the whole plan together."}}],"resources":["weekend.html","courtyard.webp","characters.webp","audio/ddf31935456f9a389761.m4a","audio/34e0a35d2cfdd7e1ecd1.m4a","audio/581638086716b6fe1b20.m4a","audio/19effdd6caad9e045c79.m4a","audio/b6fedaaeea846ffe1c1b.m4a","audio/f95a840cde3279fb282e.m4a","audio/0a99e5f80c685e4f501c.m4a","audio/63d9d2ab4827443f6259.m4a","audio/e6bbe0e8d9019f92cce3.m4a","audio/407b6547575afe3f2f22.m4a","audio/3de6753e78cbb068e431.m4a","audio/7487824b67e7d4f35c3e.m4a","audio/78cda40dd6f6a73bf68b.m4a","audio/f2f7bf164d5f201eda57.m4a","audio/fc20ce9794b782097676.m4a","audio/737ba464eea621fcd1a7.m4a","audio/a6469e8ce380ba7d846c.m4a","audio/2516e78141c4bef0f968.m4a"]};
/* Presentation only. The parent owns identity, validation, audio and local saves. */
Config.history.maxStates = 1;
Config.history.controls = false;
Config.saves.isAllowed = () => false;
Config.ui.stowBarInitially = true;
Config.passages.nobr = true;
const channel = new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1)).get('channel');
let snapshot = null;
let pending = false;
let order = [];
let settingsOpen = false;
let hotkeys = ['1','2','3','4','5','6'];
let playKey = 'p';
const characters = {lin:['Ms Lin · my neighbour',0],chen:['Chen · my colleague',1],zhou:['Ms Zhou · teahouse owner',2]};
function send(type, payload = {}) {
  if (parent === window || !channel) return;
  parent.postMessage({protocol:'chunky-game-v1',channel,type,...payload},location.origin);
}
function act(type, extra = {}) { if(pending)return;pending=true;send('action',{revision:snapshot.revision,action:{type,...extra}}); }
function el(tag, text, cls) { const n=document.createElement(tag); if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=text; if(cls)n.className=cls; return n; }
function button(label, fn, key) { const b=el('button',label); b.type='button'; b.onclick=fn; if(key)b.dataset.key=key; return b; }
function speak(audio) { if(audio)send('audio',{audio}); }
function zhLine(line, root) {
  const p=el('p',line.zh,'chinese'); p.lang='zh-CN'; root.append(p);
  if(snapshot.pinyin)root.append(el('p',line.pinyin,'pinyin'));
  root.append(button('▶ Hear Mandarin',()=>speak(line.audio),'hear'));
  root.append(button(snapshot.meaning?'Hide meaning':'Show meaning',()=>act('meaning'),'meaning'));
  if(snapshot.meaning)root.append(el('p',line.english,'translation'));
}
function render(root) {
  root.replaceChildren();
  if (!snapshot) { root.append(el('p',parent===window?'Open this episode from Game in Chunky Chinese to save your progress.':'Opening your conversation…')); return; }
  const a=snapshot, ep=setup.episode, scene=ep.scenes[a.step];
  if(!scene) {
    root.append(el('p','EPISODE COMPLETE','eyebrow'),el('h1','Things I can now say'),el('p',ep.ending));
    a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const c=ep.scenes[i].choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId),ans=c[a.variant];const card=el('section',undefined,'receipt');const line=el('p',ans.chunks.join(''),'chinese');line.lang='zh-CN';card.append(line,el('p',ans.english),el('small',r.independent?'Independently':'With support'),button('▶ Hear my sentence',()=>speak(ans.audio)));root.append(card)});
    root.append(el('p','Recognition guides difficulty; these conversations do not change your flashcard ratings.'),button('Back to Game',()=>send('exit'),'exit'));
    return;
  }
  const char=characters[scene.speaker];
  const c=scene.choices.find(c=>c.id===a.choiceId);
  const art=el('div',undefined,'scene-art');
  const portrait=el('img',undefined,'portrait');portrait.src='characters.webp';portrait.alt='';portrait.style.setProperty('--person',char[1]);portrait.onerror=()=>portrait.remove();
  // A clipped atlas shows only the current interlocutor, with their name as fallback.
  const crop=el('div',undefined,'portrait-crop');crop.append(portrait);art.append(crop,el('span',ep.place,'place'));root.append(art);
  const panel=el('section',undefined,'dialogue');
  panel.append(el('p',`${a.step+1} / ${ep.scenes.length} · ${char[0]}`,'eyebrow'));
  const heading=el('h1',scene.title);heading.tabIndex=-1;panel.append(heading);
  if(scene.callback && a.callbacks.includes(scene.callback.flag))panel.append(el('p',scene.callback.text,'callback'));
  // Assistive technology gets the full narrative immediately; visual pacing is optional.
  if(a.paragraph>=scene.paragraphs.length){const moment=el('details');moment.append(el('summary','Recall this moment'),el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));panel.append(moment)}
  else {const sr=el('div',scene.paragraphs.join(' '),'sr-only');panel.append(sr);
  scene.paragraphs.slice(0,a.paragraph+1).forEach(t=>{const p=el('p',t);p.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');panel.append(p)})}
  if(a.paragraph<scene.paragraphs.length) {
    panel.append(button('Next',()=>act('reveal'),'next'),button('Show all',()=>act('showAll'),'showAll'));root.append(panel);return;
  }
  if(scene.promptMode==='listen' && !a.transcript && !a.solved){
    const listen=el('section',undefined,'listening-prompt');listen.append(el('p','Listen closely…','chinese'),button(a.heard?'▶ Replay':'▶ Listen',()=>speak(scene.line.audio),'hear'),button('Show transcript',()=>act('transcript'),'transcript'));
    listen.append(el('p',a.heard?'Choose the reply that fits. You can replay as often as you like.':'Listen to the full question, then choose a reply. Or use Show transcript for support.'));panel.append(listen);
  } else zhLine(scene.line,panel);
  const settings=el('details',undefined,'settings');settings.open=settingsOpen;settings.ontoggle=()=>{settingsOpen=settings.open};settings.append(el('summary','Game settings'),button(a.pinyin?'Pinyin: on':'Pinyin: off',()=>act('pinyin'),'pinyin'),button(a.clues?'English clues: on':'English clues: off',()=>act('clues'),'clues'));panel.append(settings);
  if(a.clues)panel.append(el('p',scene.clue,'goal-clue'));
  else if(!a.solved && scene.kind==='choice')panel.append(button('Hint',()=>act('hint'),'hint'));
  const recall=el('div');
  a.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const s=ep.scenes[i],c=s.choices.find(c=>c.id===r.choiceId);recall.append(el('p',`${s.line.zh} — ${c[a.variant].chunks.join('')}`),el('p',c.responseLine?.zh||c.response))});
  if(!a.results.length)recall.append(el('p',scene.paragraphs.join(' ')));
  if(scene.kind==='choice') {
    const responses=el('div',undefined,'reply-options');
    order.forEach((id,pos)=>{const option=scene.options[id];if(!option)return;const card=el('div',undefined,'reply-option');const b=button('',()=>act('answer',{choiceId:option.id}),`option-${id}`);b.disabled=a.solved||(scene.promptMode==='listen'&&!a.heard&&!a.transcript);b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[pos]||String(pos+1);b.append(el('small',String(pos+1)),el('span',option[a.variant],'chinese'));b.lang='zh-CN';if(a.pinyin)b.append(el('span',option[`${a.variant}Pinyin`],'pinyin'));card.append(b,button('▶',()=>speak(option[`${a.variant}Audio`]),`listen-${id}`));card.lastChild.setAttribute('aria-label',`Hear response ${pos+1}`);responses.append(card)});panel.append(responses);
  } else if(c) {
    const answer=c[a.variant], chunks=[...answer.chunks,...(answer.distractors||[])], pinyin=[...answer.pinyin,...(answer.distractorPinyin||[])];
    const selected=el('div',undefined,'sentence');selected.setAttribute('aria-label','My sentence');
    a.tiles.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button(chunks[id],()=>act('remove',{index:pos}),`remove-${pos}`);b.lang='zh-CN';b.disabled=a.solved;b.setAttribute('aria-label',`Remove ${chunks[id]}`);selected.append(b)});
    if(!a.tiles.length)selected.append(el('span','Tap chunks below to build your reply.','empty'));panel.append(selected);
    const bank=el('div',undefined,'chunks');bank.setAttribute('aria-label','Available chunks');
    order.forEach((id,pos)=>{const b=button('',()=>act('tile',{index:id}),`tile-${id}`);b.disabled=a.tiles.includes(id)||a.solved;b.dataset.shortcut=hotkeys[pos]||String(pos+1);b.append(el('small',String(pos+1)),el('span',chunks[id]));b.lang='zh-CN';if(a.pinyin)b.append(el('small',pinyin[id]));bank.append(b)});panel.append(bank);
    const controls=el('div',undefined,'controls');
    if(!a.solved) {
      controls.append(button('Undo',()=>act('undo'),'undo'),button('Clear',()=>act('clear'),'clear'),button('Hint',()=>act('hint'),'hint'),button('Check',()=>act('check'),'check'));
      if(a.errors>=2)controls.append(button('Show worked answer',()=>act('model'),'model'));
    }
    panel.append(controls);
    panel.append(el('small','Choose only the chunks you need. Extra chunks can stay in the bank.','keyboard-help'));
  }
  if(a.feedback){const f=el('p',a.feedback,'feedback');f.setAttribute('role','status');panel.append(f)}
  if(a.solved && c){
    const answer=c[a.variant], response=el('section',undefined,'response');
    if(c.responseLine){response.lang='zh-CN';response.append(el('p',c.responseLine.zh,'chinese'));if(a.pinyin)response.append(el('p',c.responseLine.pinyin,'pinyin'));response.append(button('▶ Hear their reply',()=>speak(c.responseLine.audio),'response-audio'));if(a.meaning)response.append(el('p',c.responseLine.english));}
    panel.append(response,button('▶ Hear my reply',()=>speak(answer.audio),'reply'),button(a.step===ep.scenes.length-1?'Finish episode':'Continue',()=>act('next'),'continue'));
  }
  const more=el('details');more.append(el('summary','Recall the conversation'),recall);panel.append(more);
  root.append(panel);
}
Macro.add('chengduScene',{handler:function(){const root=el('main',undefined,'chengdu');this.output.append(root);render(root)}});
window.addEventListener('message',event=>{
  const m=event.data;
  if(event.source!==parent||event.origin!==location.origin||m?.protocol!=='chunky-game-v1'||m.channel!==channel||m.type!=='state'||!m.state||m.state.episodeId!==setup.episode.id||m.state.version!==setup.episode.version)return;
  pending=false;
  const before=snapshot;
  snapshot=m.state;
  order=Array.isArray(m.order)?m.order:[];
  if(Array.isArray(m.hotkeys))hotkeys=m.hotkeys;
  if(typeof m.playKey==='string')playKey=m.playKey;
  const passage=snapshot.step===setup.episode.scenes.length?'Ending':`Scene${snapshot.step+1}`;
  const focusKey=document.activeElement?.dataset?.key;
  if(State.passage!==passage)Engine.play(passage);
  else {const root=document.querySelector('.chengdu');if(root)render(root)}
  if(before && (before.step!==snapshot.step || (!before.choiceId && snapshot.choiceId)))window.scrollTo(0,0);
  if(before){const controls=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button'));const focus=controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key===focusKey&&!b.disabled)||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.key==='continue')||controls.find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut&&!b.disabled)||document.querySelector('h1');focus?.focus({preventScroll:true})}
});
window.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{
  if(event.ctrlKey||event.metaKey||event.altKey||event.repeat||!snapshot)return;
  if(event.key.toLowerCase()===playKey.toLowerCase()){event.preventDefault();speak(setup.episode.scenes[snapshot.step]?.line.audio);return}
  const b=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[data-shortcut]')).find(b=>b.dataset.shortcut?.toLowerCase()===event.key.toLowerCase()&&!b.disabled);
  if(b){event.preventDefault();b.click()}
});
$(document).one(':storyready',()=>send('ready'));


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#253b32;background:#f5efdf}body{margin:0;background:#f5efdf;color:#253b32}#ui-bar,#story-title{display:none}#story{margin:0;padding:0}#passages{max-width:820px;margin:auto}.passage{padding:0}.chengdu{padding:0 0 24px}.scene-art{height:205px;position:relative;background:#b9c9a3 url('courtyard.webp') center 52%/cover;image-rendering:pixelated;border-bottom:5px solid #37654a;overflow:hidden}.portrait-crop{position:absolute;width:97px;height:194px;bottom:0;right:12%;overflow:hidden}.portrait{height:194px;width:291px;max-width:none;position:absolute;left:calc(var(--person) * -97px);image-rendering:pixelated}.place{position:absolute;left:18px;top:18px;background:#183d30;color:#fff6df;padding:8px 15px;border:2px solid #dbba75;font-weight:700}.dialogue,.chengdu>h1,.chengdu>p,.receipt{margin:0;padding:18px 24px}.dialogue p{line-height:1.65;margin:10px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#456251}.dialogue h1,.chengdu>h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;margin:10px 0 18px}h2{font-size:18px;margin-top:22px}.chinese{font-size:25px!important;line-height:1.6!important;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.pinyin{color:#625540;font-size:15px}.translation,.intention{color:#52634f}.callback{border-left:3px solid #c19850;padding:8px 12px;background:#efe4c9}button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;color:#254332;background:#fffdf7;border:2px solid #9ba991;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 0 #c9c5b4}button:hover{background:#eee8cc;border-color:#446e4e}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b46a27;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}button[data-key=check],button[data-key=continue],button[data-key=next]{background:#285d42;color:#fff;border-color:#285d42}.sentence{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:72px;background:#eee7d4;border:2px dashed #a2ad94;border-radius:12px;padding:9px;margin:12px 0}.sentence button{font-size:23px;margin:2px}.empty{font-size:14px;color:#6b745f}.chunks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}.chunks button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;min-width:68px;font-size:23px}.chunks small{font-size:12px;color:#59654b}.feedback{background:#e7ead7;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.response{border-left:4px solid #b9853a;padding:12px}.aside{margin-top:16px}details{margin:12px 0;font-size:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:32px}.receipt{border-top:1px solid #c5cab8}.receipt small{display:inline-block;color:#47624a}.keyboard-help{display:block;color:#68715f;margin-top:14px}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:460px){.dialogue{padding:16px}.scene-art{height:165px}.portrait-crop{right:8%;height:154px;width:77px}.portrait{height:154px;width:231px;left:calc(var(--person) * -77px)}.dialogue h1{font-size:22px}.chunks button{font-size:21px;padding:8px;min-width:56px}.keyboard-help{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}

.scene-art{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}.dialogue>button{font-size:13px;padding:8px 10px}.dialogue details{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h1{margin-bottom:10px}@media(max-width:460px){.scene-art{height:125px}.portrait-crop{height:120px;width:60px}.portrait{height:120px;width:180px;left:calc(var(--person) * -60px)}.dialogue{padding:12px 16px}.dialogue h1{font-size:20px}.dialogue p{margin:6px 0}.dialogue h2{margin-top:14px}.place{padding:5px 10px;top:12px;left:12px;font-size:12px}}

/* SugarCube’s stowed sidebar otherwise reserves a left gutter on phones. */
#story,#ui-bar.stowed~#story{margin:0!important;padding:0!important}#passages{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}#ui-bar-tray{display:none!important}
/* Keep the speaker close: enlarge and crop the existing original character atlas at the waist. */
.scene-art{height:220px;position:relative}.portrait-crop{width:240px;height:210px;right:calc(50% - 120px);bottom:0}.portrait{width:720px;height:480px;left:calc(var(--person) * -240px);top:0}.dialogue h1{font-size:16px;color:#57634e}.dialogue>.chinese{font-size:30px!important;margin-top:12px}.goal-clue{border-left:3px solid #b9853a;padding:8px 12px;background:#eee5cc;font-size:14px}.reply-options{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.reply-option{display:flex;gap:4px}.reply-option>button:first-child{flex:1;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0}.reply-option>button:last-child{align-self:center;min-width:44px}.reply-option .chinese{font-size:24px!important}.reply-option small{font-size:12px}.settings{font-size:13px}.response{margin-top:16px}.dialogue>details:first-of-type{color:#59654b}@media(min-width:700px){.reply-options{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.reply-option{flex-direction:column}.reply-option>button:first-child{width:100%}.reply-option>button:last-child{align-self:flex-end}}@media(max-width:460px){.scene-art{height:165px}.portrait-crop{width:180px;height:160px;right:calc(50% - 90px)}.portrait{width:540px;height:360px;left:calc(var(--person) * -180px)}.place{font-size:11px;max-width:100px}.dialogue>.chinese{font-size:26px!important}.dialogue h1{font-size:15px}.pinyin{font-size:14px}.reply-option .chinese{font-size:23px!important}}


